<title>UK: Kenwood sees H2 pretax profits below H1.</title>
<headline>Kenwood sees H2 pretax profits below H1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Kenwood Appliances Plc said on Tuesday it expected group pretax profits in the second half of the year to April 4 to be significantly lower than the first half level.</p>
</text>
